<title>FINLAND: UNIBANK SEES ANOTHER MARKKA SPURT IN Q1.</title>
<headline>UNIBANK SEES ANOTHER MARKKA SPURT IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Unibank said it is expecting another surge in the Finnish markka in the first quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;...we expect another markka rally in Q1 primarily driven by strong economic fundmentals in Finland,&quot; Unibank said in its weekly research note.</p>
<p>Unibank said key levels for DEM/FIM was at 3.0225/3.0030 and at 2.9400/2.8990.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
